@ Project Grounded: teksten van de Burglar-scene (data/scripts/burglar.inc). Placeholders in de huisstijl.

Burglar_Text_Again::
	.string "SIMON: Oh, come ON. You again?\p"
	.string "Do you follow me around? That's creepy.\n"
	.string "Following people around is MY job.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro0::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "This? This is my television. I always\n"
	.string "carry my television around at night.\p"
	.string "It's called being a cord-cutter. Look it\n"
	.string "up.\p"
	.string "Now, you saw nothing. And I'm going to\n"
	.string "make very sure of that.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro1::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "Yes, it's an anchor. Yes, it's heavy. No, I\n"
	.string "did not think this through.\p"
	.string "You're going to forget my face now.\n"
	.string "Voluntarily or with fire. Mostly fire.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro2::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "This painting is a modern art piece\n"
	.string "called “Man Leaving House Normally.”\p"
	.string "Very avant-garde. Very not stolen. And\n"
	.string "you're ruining the exhibition.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro3::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "It's a sock full of coins. Some old man's\n"
	.string "entire pension.\p"
	.string "Don't look at me like that. I have\n"
	.string "expenses too. Have you SEEN the rent in\l"
	.string "RUSTBORO?$"

Burglar_Text_Intro4::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "I thought this jar had cookies in it. It\n"
	.string "does not have cookies in it.\p"
	.string "It has GRANDPA in it.\p"
	.string "Anyway. Now you've seen too much. So\n"
	.string "have I, frankly.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro5::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "Team MAGMA took the big meteorite. I'm\n"
	.string "taking the small one. It's called the gig\l"
	.string "economy.\p"
	.string "And I don't leave witnesses. Especially\n"
	.string "not ones with a POKéDEX.$"

Burglar_Text_Intro6::
	.string "SIMON: ...!\p"
	.string "It's a napkin, signed by NORMAN, the GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER. He also used it. Twice.\p"
	.string "The collectors' market is insane right\n"
	.string "now.\p"
	.string "Wait. You're NORMAN's kid? Great. Now\n"
	.string "it's personal AND profitable.$"

Burglar_Text_Defeat::
	.string "I've been robbed!\p"
	.string "...Oh. So THAT's what that feels like.$"

Burglar_Text_Stunned::
	.string "SIMON: ......\p"
	.string "...I lost. To a child. At my own crime\n"
	.string "scene.\p"
	.string "This is going on my performance review.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident0::
	.string "Hey! That's my TV!\p"
	.string "I was in the middle of a twelve-hour\n"
	.string "MAGIKARP documentary! It was just\l"
	.string "getting good!\p"
	.string "Give. ...Thank you.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident1::
	.string "My anchor! That's a family heirloom!\p"
	.string "My great-grandpa was a sailor. A very\n"
	.string "bad one. Hence the spare anchor.\p"
	.string "Hand it over, landlubber.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident2::
	.string "KECLEON: Kekleh! Ke-KEH! Kekekeh!\p"
	.string "…KECCLES? Is that you? Since when do\n"
	.string "you live in LILYCOVE?\p"
	.string "KECLEON: …Ke?\p"
	.string "Oh wait. The only KECLEON that can\n"
	.string "talk is KECCLES.\p"
	.string "This one just wants its painting back.\n"
	.string "Probably. It's pointing at it with its\l"
	.string "whole face.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident3::
	.string "My sock! My whole pension is in that\n"
	.string "sock!\p"
	.string "Thirty years at DEVON, and all I got was\n"
	.string "a sock full of coins and a bad hip.\p"
	.string "Give it here, you hooligan.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident4::
	.string "GRANDPA!\p"
	.string "...Careful, he hates being shaken. He\n"
	.string "hated it when he was alive, too.\p"
	.string "Hand him over, please.$"

Burglar_Text_Resident5::
	.string "COZMO: Not my METEORITE! I talk to\n"
	.string "that rock more than to my wife!\p"
	.string "…Please don't tell her. She thinks it's\n"
	.string "the other way around. Give it back!$"

Burglar_Text_Resident6::
	.string "That's NORMAN's napkin! He used it at my\n"
	.string "barbecue!\p"
	.string "The napkin is the valuable part. Don't\n"
	.string "ask. Give.$"

Burglar_Text_Flee::
	.string "SIMON: This isn't over! I have a very\n"
	.string "flexible schedule!$"

Burglar_Text_Dropped::
	.string "SIMON dropped something while running\n"
	.string "away!$"

Burglar_Text_ThanksKecleon::
	.string "KECLEON: Kekleh!\p"
	.string "It turned the same color as the\n"
	.string "painting. That's probably a thank you.\p"
	.string "Keep whatever he dropped. The KECLEON\n"
	.string "has no use for money. Or pockets.$"

Burglar_Text_Thanks::
	.string "Thank you, kid. HOENN has no police. We\n"
	.string "have children with animals.\p"
	.string "Keep whatever he dropped. It was\n"
	.string "probably stolen from someone else\l"
	.string "anyway.$"
